<title>UK: First Ghana cocoa purchases ahead of year earlier.</title>
<headline>First Ghana cocoa purchases ahead of year earlier.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ghana cocoa purchases in the first week of the 1996/97 season totalled 32,130 tonnes compared with 22,843 tonnes in the same period of the previous 1995/96 season.</p>
<p>The Ghana Cocoa Board said first purchases ran up to the week ending October 17.</p>
<p>-- Clelia Oziel, London Newsroom 44 171 542 8072</p>
</text>
